         <ab xml:space="preserve"><gap reason="omitted"/>    <pb n="22b"/><lb n="27a6"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex013112026-10-1410-24-18" status="reviewed"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="db:3834">kha cig</rs> <note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="" ref="db:3834">stod rgya</rs></note> dgag bya dngos po la grub pa rigs shes kyis bkag pa'i stong nyid med pas na chos rnams ni sdod nas stong pa yin no zhes gsungs pa ni 
         legs par mi <lb n="27a7"/> sems te | snga ma <note type="gloss">dgag bya grub par</note> su yang mi 'dod pa'i phyir dang | phyi ma yang yang dag par yongs gcod du med pa'i phyir ro || </seg><gap reason="omitted"/> </ab>
